    "description": "The series follows the staff of \"Trance,\" an Israeli airline, offering a glimpse into the high-flying lives of pilots, flight attendants, security personnel, and managers. From the busy offices to the intensity of international flights and their personal lives on the ground, the story explores the complex web of relationships among the crew. Amidst the clouds and between destinations, the characters navigate love stories, friendships, betrayals, and rivalries, all while facing the obstacles on their journey toward happiness and self-fulfillment.",
